;; Reconstructed names describe observed behavior; original source names are unknown.
;; Globals retain the archived c7 layout. All numeric method IDs are explicit.
;; tuple slots: context=(flags,sender,value,original_fee); base=(factory,blank_code).
;; amounts=(asset0,asset1); assets=(pool_type,asset0_slice,asset1_slice).
